From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Simon Elsbrock <simon@iodev.org>
Date: Sun, 15 Nov 2026 13:50:00 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 20/27] misc: mediatek: port the MT8163 CONSYS driver to Linux
 6.12

- class_create(THIS_MODULE, name) -> class_create(name) (7 files)
- platform_driver.remove returns void (btif, consys_hw, wlan platform)
- no_llseek removed: drop .llseek, unseekable is the 6.12 default (compat/wmt_detect_abi.c)
- hci_dev.dev_type / HCI_PRIMARY gone: drop the primary-type assignment
- sched_clock() needs <linux/sched/clock.h> (wlan stats.c)
---
 .../mt8163-connectivity/btif/common/btif_audio_ts.c        | 2 +-
 .../mediatek/mt8163-connectivity/btif/common/mtk_btif.c    | 7 +++----
 .../mediatek/mt8163-connectivity/compat/wmt_detect_abi.c   | 3 +--
 .../conn_soc/common/linux/pri/wmt_dev.c                    | 2 +-
